Maintainer: Example Maintainer <maintainer@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13), cmake, make, gcc, libpam-dev, libgssapi-krb5-dev, libssl-dev, uuid-dev, libx11-dev, libxtst-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://example.com/frdpd

Package: frdpd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libpam0g, sssd, xvfb
Description: FreeRDP-based RDP server with PAM/SSSD/NLA
 This package provides the frdpd daemon, authentication helpers and session manager.
 It supports password-backed NLA (CredSSP) through PAM/SSSD and prototype session management.
 Kerberos-first authentication is not installed as a production runtime path yet.
